                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "🍵【Xianminglou - A Cup of Hot Oolong Tea for Dinner】🍴\n\nDinner was paired with a cup of Xianminglou hot oolong tea, the sugar-free version chosen.\n\nThe tea\u0027s aroma was delicate, its taste smooth and refreshing, without a trace of heaviness.\n\nThe warm tea complemented the food,\n\nnot only cutting through the richness but also creating a tranquil and comfortable atmosphere for the entire dinner.\n\nOccasionally, on busy days,\nI allow myself a cup of pure oolong tea,\nand a simple dinner, to find a moment of leisure and peace.\n\n#Xianminglou #HotOolong #SugarFreeIsPerfect #TeaDinner #SmallHappiness",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "🍵【閑茗樓・一杯熱烏龍的晚餐時光】🍴\n\n晚餐配上一杯 閑茗樓熱烏龍，選擇了 無糖版本，\n茶香清雅、入口溫潤，沒有一絲負擔。\n\n熱熱的茶氣襯托著餐點，\n不僅解膩，更把整個晚餐氛圍變得沉靜而舒服。\n\n偶爾在忙碌的日子裡，\n讓自己用一杯純粹的烏龍茶，\n和一份簡單的晚餐，\n換來一點閑適與平靜。\n\n#閑茗樓 #熱烏龍 #無糖最對味 #茶香晚餐 #小確幸",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
